#. module: eh_log_quotation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_log_quotation.field_sale_order_line__eh_log_is_disbursement
msgid ""
"When True, the line is treated as pass-through and excluded from gross "
"margin computation."
msgstr ""
"Jika True, baris diperlakukan sebagai pass-through dan dikecualikan dari "
"perhitungan margin kotor."

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_log_quotation.field_eh_log_charge_template_apply__replace_existing
msgid ""
"When checked, existing logistics charge lines (lines carrying a charge code)"
" are removed before the template lines are appended. Non-logistics product "
"lines are always preserved."
msgstr ""
"Jika dicentang, baris biaya logistik yang ada (baris yang membawa kode "
"biaya) dihapus sebelum baris templat ditambahkan. Baris produk non-logistik "
"selalu dipertahankan."

#. module: eh_log_quotation
